ding to yellow cards for Derensili Sanches Fernandes and Marcus Browne . While AFC Wimbledon pushed forward, they left gaps at the back that the resilient home side were more than happy to exploit. In the 77th minute, the result was put beyond doubt. Radinio Balker provided a superb assist for Bojan Radulovic , who powered home a shot to make it 3-0. The final whistle confirmed a remarkable victory for Huddersfield , who combined clinical finishing with grit and determination to overcome their mid-match setback and secure all three points."
